<title>JAPAN: Sansei Yusoki - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Sansei Yusoki - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>   (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		     (six months)		   (eight months)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.03		vs	   17.14</p>
